# Memory engram protocol

**SUPERSEDED** by `16-session-memory-protocol.mdc` (alwaysApply: true).

This rule is kept for reference only. The new canonical memory location is
`top-code-memory/` with archiving hooks in `.cursor/hooks/session-stop-engram.js`.

Key changes:
- Old: `knowledge/memory/engrams/` (manual, never used)
- New: `top-code-memory/sessions/` (auto-archived by hooks)
- Old: agent manually writes engram at session end
- New: agent writes `LAST_SESSION.md`, hooks archive it

| Old path | New path |
|----------|----------|
| `knowledge/memory/LAST_SESSION.md` | BOTH `knowledge/memory/` AND `top-code-memory/` |
| `knowledge/memory/engrams/*.md` | `top-code-memory/sessions/*.md` |
| — | `top-code-memory/INDEX.md` (auto) |
| — | `top-code-memory/DRIFT.md` (auto) |
